## 🎯 Quality Checklist (Cek sebelum kirim kode)

Sebelum memberikan kode final, pastikan:
- [ ] Semua warna menggunakan CSS custom properties
- [ ] Spacing mengikuti 8pt grid
- [ ] Typography hierarchy jelas (h1 > h2 > h3 > body)
- [ ] Responsive di mobile, tablet, desktop
- [ ] Hover & focus states ada di semua interactive elements
- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` sudah di-handle
- [ ] Semantic HTML, bukan div soup
- [ ] Alt text lengkap di semua gambar
- [ ] Contrast ratio memenuhi WCAG AA
- [ ] Kode clean, readable, well-commented

